        <mxCell id="pam-title" value="特权访问管理 (PAM) &amp; 权限管理 (CIEM)" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0066FF;fontFamily=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="96" y="816" width="780" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="pam-content" value="• JIT (Just-in-Time) Access - 临时权限授予&#10;• 权限最小化 (Least Privilege)&#10;• 会话录制与审计 (Session Recording)&#10;• 权限分析与异常检测 (Permission Analytics)" style="text;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="120" y="856" width="1740" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ciem-shadow" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#E5E7EB;strokeColor=NONE;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="944" y="800" width="776" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ciem-bg" value="" style="rounded=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E0E7FF;strokeWidth=2;arcSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="944" y="800" width="776" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ciem-title" value="Zero Trust 原则" style="text;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#0066FF;fontFamily=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="960" y="816" width="736" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="ciem-content" value="• 永不信任,持续验证 (Never Trust, Always Verify)&#10;• 基于上下文的访问控制 (Context-Aware Access)&#10;• 设备健康检查 (Device Posture)&#10;• 行为分析与异常检测 (Behavioral Analytics)" style="text;fontSize=16;fontColor=#1A1A1A;fontFamily=PingFang SC,Microsoft YaHei,Noto Sans SC,sans-serif;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="976" y="856" width="1910" height="140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        
